silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_03_dependency_and_mittens_legs_concrete_anchor_10#mittensadmissionmorphism_admit silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensAdmissionMorphism_admit is The admit morphism: the unique factorization of a source witness into place o type o interpret o cite; admits the witness as a typed Forge leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'AdmissionMorphism', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
